  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PROTECT - Protection of Persons of Concern (PoC) including migrants, forced displaced and vulnerable host communities along migratory routes in Sudan - phase II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The action focuses on improving access to assistance and protection services for different categories of migrants and displaced, including the people affected by the current armed conflict. The action takes a nexus approach to bridge humanitarian direct assistance with development interventions aimed at securing access to the health services, building up the referral system and improving protection services. The activities are implemented with the Sudanese Red Crescent Society and will improve its capacity in humanitarian diplomacy, mapping migration policies, services and strategic planning.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
